DATA AND LICENSING

This software is MIT-licensed. The data it downloads is not, and is not
redistributed with this repository.

  - SEC EDGAR filings and XBRL data: US Government works, public domain,
    subject to the SEC's fair-access policy (declared User-Agent,
    <=10 requests/second). https://www.sec.gov/os/webmaster-faq
  - FRED (St. Louis Fed): free API, attribution required.
  - Ken French Data Library: free for research use, attribution required.
  - Index constituent files (e.g. IVV, SPY): provider terms apply; fetched
    for local research only, never redistributed.
  - Daily prices from unofficial sources (Stooq/yfinance): disabled by
    default; see docs/SOURCE_REGISTRY.md.

Reports generated by this tool are research output, not investment advice.
